  <History Date="15-01-07" Author="D.Milligan" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="10-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Aligned attribute ID numbers with attribute names.  Added Red1,Green1,Blue1 and replaced first cell in multi-cell modes." />
  <History Date="10-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added palettes.  Fixed power on and locate.  Removed clear values." />
  <History Date="10-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="06-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from LED ColorBar to COLORbar (LED-BAR)" />
  <History Date="06-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed invalid modes.  Changed cell mode to hidden.  Revised mode names." />
  <History Date="06-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed control to default to respective mode ranges." />
  <History Date="10-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
